{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.BindingManybodyJetFiltration","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.BindingManybodyJetFiltration","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Ring.Finset"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.binding_eq_me_sw_series","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.binding_eq_me_sw_series","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-manybody-jet-filtration.lean#L53-L59","doc":"**Conditional corollary** (proved from the conjecture class, no `sorry`):\nbinding equals `m_e` times the truncated sum of Seiberg–Witten periods. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingManyBodyJetFiltration.series_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingManyBodyJetFiltration.series_eq","kind":"theorem","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-manybody-jet-filtration.lean#L51-L51","doc":"Binding is the body-order series (= the jet-order filtration). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingManyBodyJetFiltration.term_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingManyBodyJetFiltration.term_eq","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-manybody-jet-filtration.lean#L49-L49","doc":"Each `n`-body term is `m_e` times the `n`-th SW period. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingManyBodyJetFiltration.binding","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingManyBodyJetFiltration.binding","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-manybody-jet-filtration.lean#L47-L47","doc":"The total binding `B(K)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingManyBodyJetFiltration.bodyTerm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingManyBodyJetFiltration.bodyTerm","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-manybody-jet-filtration.lean#L45-L45","doc":"The `n`-body binding term `B_n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingManyBodyJetFiltration.swPeriod","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingManyBodyJetFiltration.swPeriod","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-manybody-jet-filtration.lean#L43-L43","doc":"The `n`-th prolonged SW period `a_D^{(n)} = ∮ λ_SW^{(n)}`\n(a residue sum over hyperbolic components, `prop:sw-period-residue-sum`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingManyBodyJetFiltration.maxOrder","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingManyBodyJetFiltration.maxOrder","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-manybody-jet-filtration.lean#L40-L40","doc":"Highest body order retained in the truncation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingManyBodyJetFiltration.m_e","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingManyBodyJetFiltration.m_e","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-manybody-jet-filtration.lean#L38-L38","doc":"The electron-mass scale `m_e`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingManyBodyJetFiltration.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingManyBodyJetFiltration.mk","kind":"ctor","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-manybody-jet-filtration.lean#L36-L36","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingManyBodyJetFiltration","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingManyBodyJetFiltration","kind":"class","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-manybody-jet-filtration.lean#L32-L51","doc":"**Conjecture class.** Encodes\n`B(K) = Σ_{n<maxOrder} B_n`, `B_n = m_e · a_D^{(n)}`, with the SW\nperiods `a_D^{(n)}` supplied by `prop:sw-period-residue-sum`. An\ninstance asserts the conjecture for the carrier `R`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:binding-manybody-eq-jet-filtration","label":"conj:binding-manybody-eq-jet-filtration","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-manybody-jet-filtration.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}